      "id": "secondly",
      "word": "secondly",
      "meaning": "adv. 其次，第二点。【易错警示】：常误拼为 seccondly（多写c）或 secondely。记忆法：second + ly，中间只有一个 c。用于雅思大作文主体段第2个核心论点的句首引出。",
      "sentence": "Secondly, professions that require creativity and empathy are unlikely to be completely replaced by artificial intelligence.",
