    "creativity": {
      "id": "creativity",
      "word": "creativity",
      "meaning": "n. 创造力，创造性。【易错警示】：常漏写词尾y拼为 creativit，或混淆为 creativeness。构词法：create (v.) -> creative (adj.) -> creativity (n.)。雅思教育、科技类论证核心高频词。",
      "sentence": "Such advanced roles demand not only original ideas and creativity but also emotional intelligence and nuanced judgment.",
