    "instead of": {
      "id": "instead of",
      "word": "instead of",
      "meaning": "prep. 代替，而不是。【易错警示】：常颠倒字母误拼为 instand of 或 insteed of。用法要求：of为介词，后接名词、代词或动名词(-ing)。是雅思中表达'舍弃A而选择B'的关键逻辑搭配。",
      "sentence": "Therefore, rather than being substituted by machines, professionals will use AI as a tool instead of being replaced by it.",
      "tags": [
        "雅思写作",
