    "opinion": {
      "id": "opinion",
      "word": "opinion",
      "meaning": "n. 意见，观点，看法。【易错警示】：常元音颠倒拼错为 opionin 或 openion。音节记忆：o-pi-nion。常用于大作文开头段与结尾段表达个人立场：in my opinion / hold the opinion that...",
      "sentence": "In my opinion, whether automation leads to widespread unemployment depends largely on the nature of the profession.",
