    "depend on": {
      "id": "depend on",
      "word": "depend on",
      "meaning": "v. 取决于，依赖，依靠。【易错警示】：常受拼音影响误拼为 depand on。构词法：de- (向下) + pend (悬挂/依靠)。近义替换：hinge on, rely on, be contingent upon。",
      "sentence": "Whether AI displaces human workers depends largely on whether the job requires routine tasks or creative thinking.",
