      "meaning": "adv. 实质性地，大幅度地，显著地。【替换目标】：a lot, largely。极其常用的学术副词，常修饰数据的增减变化：substantially increase / reduce。",
      "sentence": "Automated billing workflows substantially cut administrative overhead costs for public hospitals.",
      "tags": [
