    "severely": {
      "id": "severely",
      "word": "severely",
      "meaning": "adv. 极其严重地，严酷地，受创极深地。【替换目标】：badly, terribly。常修饰负面词汇：severely damage / undermine / restrict / suffer。",
      "sentence": "Prolonged exposure to toxic industrial runoff severely compromises the biodiversity of local river basins.",
