    "drastically": {
      "id": "drastically",
      "word": "drastically",
      "meaning": "adv. 急剧地，彻底地，戏剧性地。【替换目标】：suddenly and greatly。描述变化速度极快且幅度极大：drastically change / drop / rise。",
      "sentence": "Unforeseen geopolitical tensions drastically disrupted international maritime shipping routes.",
