    "marginally": {
      "id": "marginally",
      "word": "marginally",
      "meaning": "adv. 微幅地，边际性地，略微地。【替换目标】：a little bit, slightly。用于学术图表小作文或大作文中精确限定微小的增长或差距。",
      "sentence": "Production efficiency improved only marginally despite extensive investments in new office furniture.",
