      "id": "negligibly",
      "word": "negligibly",
      "meaning": "adv. 微不足道地，可忽略不计地。【替换目标】：very little, almost zero。学术用词，表明某项差异在统计学上或实际意义上没有实质影响。",
      "sentence": "The chemical variance between the two compound samples was negligibly small across all test runs.",
