    "another dimension worth examining is": {
      "id": "another dimension worth examining is",
      "word": "Another dimension worth examining is",
      "meaning": "句型 另一个值得审视的维度是……【替换目标】：Thirdly, Besides。用'审视维度'替换平铺直叙的'第三点'，展现深刻的多角度思辨能力。",
      "sentence": "Another dimension worth examining is the psychological burden borne by children under intense exam pressure.",
