    "is largely attributable to": {
      "id": "is largely attributable to",
      "word": "is largely attributable to",
      "meaning": "高分句型 ……很大程度上归因于……【句法亮点】：名词化因果倒装表达（结果 is attributable to 原因），极大丰富句式多样性，替换 is caused by。",
      "sentence": "The declining fertility rate across developed economies is largely attributable to exorbitant housing costs.",
      "tags": [
        "雅思写作",
        "高分句式",
        "名词化因果",
        "Band7.5"
      ],
