    "not only does ... but it also ...": {
      "id": "not only does ... but it also ...",
      "word": "Not only does ... but it also ...",
      "meaning": "高分句型 不仅……而且还……（部分倒装句）。【句法亮点】：将助动词/系动词前置于主语构成倒装，考官评价标准中 Grammatical Range 的典型提分点。",
      "sentence": "Not only does international student exchange broaden personal horizons, but it also enriches campus cultural vitality.",
      "tags": [
        "雅思写作",
        "高分句式",
        "部分倒装",
        "语法提分"
      ],
