    "while it is undeniable that ... it must also be recognized that ...": {
      "id": "while it is undeniable that ... it must also be recognized that ...",
      "word": "While it is undeniable that ... it must also be recognized that ...",
      "meaning": "高分句型 不可否认的是……但同时也必须认识到……（双重让步平衡句）。【句法亮点】：大作文平衡论证（Discuss both views）的万能高分母句。",
      "sentence": "While it is undeniable that automation disrupts traditional crafts, it must also be recognized that it creates innovative digital sectors.",
