    "male-dominated": {
      "id": "male-dominated",
      "word": "male-dominated",
      "meaning": "adj. 男性主导的，男性占绝大多数的。【Task 1 特征词】：复合形容词。反义词为 female-dominated。适用于计算机、工程、建筑等理科专业描述。",
      "sentence": "Computer Science remained the most male-dominated discipline, with men accounting for approximately 72.4% of total enrollment.",
