    "female counterpart": {
      "id": "female counterpart",
      "word": "female counterpart",
      "meaning": "短语 对应的女性同行，对应的女性群体。【Task 1 同义替换】：在整篇小作文中避免重复出现 female students / girls，counterpart 指对应的人或物。",
      "sentence": "While men predominated in engineering disciplines, their female counterparts demonstrated far greater representation in medicine.",
