    "balanced representation": {
      "id": "balanced representation",
      "word": "balanced representation",
      "meaning": "短语 相对均衡的代表分布/比例分布。【Task 1 特征词】：当某组数据男女比例接近 50%:50% 时（如本题中的法学 Law 46.5% vs 53.5%），使用该表达极为地道。",
      "sentence": "In contrast to other highly skewed faculties, the Law faculty displayed a remarkably balanced gender representation.",
