    "simultaneously": {
      "id": "simultaneously",
      "word": "Simultaneously",
      "meaning": "连接副词 与此同时，同步地。【替换目标】：At the same time, Meanwhile。强调两件事情在时间上的同步进行或因果上的双管齐下。",
      "sentence": "Governments must expand subway transit networks; simultaneously, pedestrian pathways should be upgraded.",
