    "dramatic and sustained decline": {
      "id": "dramatic and sustained decline",
      "word": "dramatic and sustained decline",
      "meaning": "短语n. 剧烈且持续的下跌走势。【Task 1 趋势】：dramatic (剧烈的) + sustained (持续不断的) + decline (下跌)。精准描述煤炭消费从 1980 到 2020 的单边跳水走势。",
