    "plummet": {
      "id": "plummet",
      "word": "plummet",
      "meaning": "v. 骤降，暴跌，垂直下跌。【Task 1 急剧下跌】：不及物动词，描述数据陡峭下跌。同义词：slump, plunge, nosedive。反义词：soar, rocket, surge。",
