    "upward trajectory": {
      "id": "upward trajectory",
      "word": "upward trajectory",
      "meaning": "短语n. 上升轨迹，爬升走势。【Task 1 走势特征】：trajectory (弹道/轨道/发展轨迹)。搭配 upward trajectory (上升走势) 或 downward trajectory (下降走势)。",
