    "career prospects and socioeconomic status": {
      "id": "career prospects and socioeconomic status",
      "word": "career prospects and socioeconomic status",
      "meaning": "短语n. 职业前景与社会经济地位。【词块解析】：prospects (前景/前途) + socioeconomic status (社会经济阶层/地位)。雅思大作文衡量高等教育核心回报的黄金搭配，替换 good jobs and money。",
