    "the proposal to eliminate ...": {
      "id": "the proposal to eliminate ...",
      "word": "the proposal to eliminate ...",
      "meaning": "短语v. 彻底取缔/免除……的提议。【词块解析】：proposal (提议/动议) + eliminate (消除/根除)。用于客观转述题目中极端的公共政策提议，替换 some people want to stop...",
