    "a blanket policy": {
      "id": "a blanket policy",
      "word": "a blanket policy",
      "meaning": "短语n. 一刀切的政策，无差别的笼统方针。【词块解析】：blanket (毛毯/全面的) + policy (政策)。形象生动地批评不顾具体情况、搞一刀切的做法。近义替换：a one-size-fits-all approach。",
      "sentence": "Implementing a blanket policy of free higher education ignores the vast wealth disparities among households.",
      "tags": [
        "雅思写作",
        "高分词块",
        "批判思维",
        "Band8"
      ],
