    "overlook": {
      "id": "overlook",
      "word": "overlook",
      "meaning": "v. 忽略，忽视，未予重视。【词块解析】：及物动词，替换 ignore, neglect。指政策或观点在制定时盲目遗漏了某些关键因素或群体差异。",
      "sentence": "Such an unselective subsidy scheme overlooks the true financial capabilities and needs of individual students.",
