    "financial capabilities": {
      "id": "financial capabilities",
      "word": "financial capabilities",
      "meaning": "短语n. 经济承受能力，财务实力。【词块解析】：capability (能力/财力)，复数 capabilities。正式学术表达，指家庭或个人承担高额开支的经济底气，替换 having enough money。",
      "sentence": "Tuition schemes should reflect household financial capabilities rather than imposing uniform fee structures.",
