    "academic merits": {
      "id": "academic merits",
      "word": "academic merits",
      "meaning": "短语n. 学业优异表现，学术资质/造诣。【词块解析】：merit (优点/功绩/优异资质)，复数 merits。指通过成绩或科研展现出的学术才华，是评定奖学金的标准，替换 good grades。",
      "sentence": "Admission to elite programs should be determined strictly by academic merits rather than parental wealth.",
