    "a differentiated approach": {
      "id": "a differentiated approach",
      "word": "a differentiated approach",
      "meaning": "短语n. 差异化方案，区别对待的分类策略。【词块解析】：differentiated (区别对待的/差异化的) + approach (方法/方案)。提出兼顾公平与效率的辩证折中方案核心词块。",
      "sentence": "A differentiated approach allows universities to charge prosperous families while funding underprivileged talents.",
