    "household income": {
      "id": "household income",
      "word": "household income",
      "meaning": "短语n. 家庭总收入。【词块解析】：household (家庭户) + income (收入)。比 family money 或 family income 更加严谨规范的经济统计术语。",
      "sentence": "Eligibility for public grants is calculated on the basis of verified household income levels.",
