    "scholarly promise": {
      "id": "scholarly promise",
      "word": "scholarly promise",
      "meaning": "短语n. 学术潜力，治学前景。【词块解析】：scholarly (学者的/学术的) + promise (这里作名词，指有出息的希望/潜质)。雅思教育类描述具有科研天赋的寒门学子极具文学美感的词块。",
      "sentence": "Universities are eager to nurture young researchers who display exceptional scholarly promise early on.",
