    "far more equitable": {
      "id": "far more equitable",
      "word": "far more equitable",
      "meaning": "短语adj. 远为公平合理的，更加公允的。【词块解析】：equitable (公平公正的，兼顾各方利益的)，比 fair 更具法理与社会学厚度。搭配 far more equitable solution。",
      "sentence": "A tiered tuition pricing model represents a far more equitable solution to university funding crises.",
