    "impoverished regions": {
      "id": "impoverished regions",
      "word": "impoverished regions",
      "meaning": "短语n. 贫困落后地区。【词块解析】：impoverished (贫困的/经济枯竭的) + regions (区域)。比 poor areas 更加严谨书面，常用于描述教育资源匮乏的乡村或偏远地区。",
      "sentence": "Public educational investments should be prioritized toward schools situated in historically impoverished regions.",
