    "local youths": {
      "id": "local youths",
      "word": "local youths",
      "meaning": "短语n. 当地青年群体。【词块解析】：youths (年轻人/青年群体)。在全篇论述中交替替换 students, young people, teenagers，增强词汇丰富度。",
      "sentence": "Without targeted financial subsidies, university attendance remains out of reach for most local youths.",
