    "virtually unattainable": {
      "id": "virtually unattainable",
      "word": "virtually unattainable",
      "meaning": "短语adj. 几乎遥不可及，实际上根本无法达到。【词块解析】：virtually (几乎/实际上) + unattainable (达不到的/高不可攀的)。极具说服力地描述由于学费昂贵，底层孩子上大学的不可能。",
      "sentence": "Exorbitant university expenses render higher academic degrees virtually unattainable for working-class children.",
