    "left unaddressed": {
      "id": "left unaddressed",
      "word": "left unaddressed",
      "meaning": "短语(条件状语) 倘若不予解决，如果任其发展。【词块解析】：分词短语作条件状语，省略了 If it is left unaddressed。短小精炼，直击问题要害，后文接灾难性后果。",
      "sentence": "Left unaddressed, the widening educational disparity will entrench intergenerational poverty.",
