    "academic potential": {
      "id": "academic potential",
      "word": "academic potential",
      "meaning": "短语n. 学术潜能，学业潜质。【词块解析】：academic (学术的) + potential (潜能)。指学生尚未完全释放的智力上限，搭配 develop / realize one's academic potential。",
      "sentence": "Comprehensive mentoring helps disadvantaged undergraduates fully unlock their latent academic potential.",
