    "living allowances": {
      "id": "living allowances",
      "word": "living allowances",
      "meaning": "短语n. 生活津贴，生活补贴。【词块解析】：allowances (定期发放的津贴/生活费)。免除学费之外还需解决日常温饱，与 tuition waiver (免学费) 互为补充。",
      "sentence": "Merit-based scholarships should bundle tuition fee waivers with monthly living allowances.",
