    "destructive": {
      "id": "destructive",
      "word": "destructive",
      "meaning": "adj. 破坏性的，毁灭性的。【易错警示】：常字母 a 错写拼为 destractive。构词法：de- (破坏) + struct (建造) + ive -> de-struc-tive（反向破坏结构的）。",
