      "id": "curb environmental degradation",
      "word": "curb environmental degradation",
      "meaning": "短语v. 遏制全球环境恶化/生态衰退。【词块解析】：curb (勒住/遏制) + environmental degradation (环境恶化)。顶格替换 protect nature / stop bad environment。",
