    "stringent industrial emissions caps": {
      "id": "stringent industrial emissions caps",
      "word": "stringent industrial emissions caps",
      "meaning": "短语n. 严苛的工业排放限额/排放上限。【词块解析】：stringent (严格紧缩的) + emissions caps (排放帽/碳配额)。体现题干 'international government regulations' 的硬核举措。",
