    "far exceeds that of ...": {
      "id": "far exceeds that of ...",
      "word": "far exceeds that of ...",
      "meaning": "短语v. 远远超过……的水平/规模。【用法解析】：代词 that 替代前面提到的不可数名词，避免表达重复。替换 incomparable to (无与伦比的，词义不当) 或 is bigger than。",
      "sentence": "The carbon footprint generated by private aviation far exceeds that of ordinary daily commuting.",
